# Capital Core Loop — learning model

Smallest complete **player-reasoning** loop. Secondary systems stay outside until cycle 1 closes.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  subgraph CYCLE1["CYCLE 1 — prove why Capital is interesting"]
    S[SITUATION<br/>Cove · fair coins · Take available]
    I[INFORMATION<br/>Foreshadow: hush vs louder gossip]
    D[PLAYER DECISION<br/>Jar before treat XOR Treat before jar]
    R[SYSTEM RESPONSE<br/>Irreversible + scar + hush + carpet CTA]
    C[VISIBLE CONSEQUENCE<br/>Harbor spectacle · plaque · Piggy homecoming]
    P[PLAYER INTERPRETATION<br/>Harbor remembers my money choice]
    V[REVISED STRATEGY<br/>Next fork weighs Harbor memory]
  end

  S --> I --> D --> R --> C --> P --> V
  V --> N[NEXT DECISION<br/>Start cycle 2 · Paycheck or digression Take]

  subgraph OUT["OUTSIDE smallest loop — do not require before C→P"]
    X1[Ashore glossary / Ready lecture]
    X2[Soft Beat / Structure toys]
    X3[Share / Witness]
    X4[Outfitter / Capsule]
    X5[Daily Ritual / Day-2]
    X6[Arcade / Studio / side magnets]
  end

  N -.->|after interpretation| X2
  N -.->|optional social| X3
  P -.->|not required| X3

  style S fill:#e2e8f0,stroke:#1c1917
  style I fill:#e2e8f0,stroke:#1c1917
  style D fill:#f4b942,stroke:#1c1917,color:#1c1917
  style R fill:#fdba74,stroke:#1c1917
  style C fill:#f4b942,stroke:#1c1917,color:#1c1917
  style P fill:#86efac,stroke:#1c1917
  style V fill:#7dd3fc,stroke:#1c1917
  style N fill:#c4b5fd,stroke:#1c1917
```

## Node → required verb / proof

| Node | Required verb | Proof the node worked |
|------|---------------|------------------------|
| SITUATION | Talk (open Take) | Player faces jar vs treat |
| INFORMATION | Attend foreshadow | Can name two Harbor futures |
| PLAYER DECISION | Choose (irreversible) | Scar + stance saved |
| SYSTEM RESPONSE | Board carpet home | Quiet + next verb clear |
| VISIBLE CONSEQUENCE | Witness Harbor + Talk Piggy | Plaque/story matches choice |
| PLAYER INTERPRETATION | (cognitive) | Retell: Harbor felt my Take |
| REVISED STRATEGY | (cognitive) | Plans next fork differently |
| NEXT DECISION | Voyage + Take again | Cycle 2 starts with memory |

